@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}

title Codex Development Workflow - Unified PR-Gated Lifecycle

state "Requirement" as requirement
state "Understand repo" as understand
state "Plan" as plan
state "Slice / Ticket if needed\n[plan-to-ticket when Ticketed]\nTicket first for multiple behaviors;\nSlices inside each Ticket" as decompose
state "Create feature branch\n(all change types)" as branch
state "Implement\n(main agent; optional bounded delegation)" as implement
state "Test\n[test-workflow]" as test
state "Redaction scan\nif applicable\n[data-document-redaction]" as redact
state "Commit\n[github-push-when-ready]" as commit
state "Push branch\n[github-push-when-ready]" as push
state "Create / Update PR\n[github-push-when-ready]" as pr
state "Automatic Review\n[codex review]" as review
state "Blocking findings?" as blocking #FFF4CC
state "Fix findings" as fix
state "Test again\n[test-workflow]" as test_again
state "Redaction scan again\nif applicable" as redact_again
state "Commit fix" as commit_fix
state "Push branch" as push_fix
state "Merge PR\n[github-push-when-ready]" as merge
state "Delete source branch" as delete_branch
state "Update main" as update_main
state "Close Ticket\nif applicable" as close_ticket
state "Update State / Docs\n[repo-current-state]" as state_docs
state "Deploy if needed\n[auto-deploy]" as deploy
state "Verify / Rollback" as verify #EAF2F8

[*] --> requirement
requirement --> understand
understand --> plan
plan --> decompose
decompose --> branch
branch --> implement
implement --> test
test --> redact
redact --> commit
commit --> push
push --> pr
pr --> review
review --> blocking
blocking --> fix : yes
blocking --> merge : no / pass
fix --> test_again
test_again --> redact_again
redact_again --> commit_fix
commit_fix --> push_fix
push_fix --> review : PR updated / review again
merge --> delete_branch
delete_branch --> update_main
update_main --> close_ticket
close_ticket --> state_docs
state_docs --> deploy : requested
state_docs --> [*] : not requested
deploy --> verify
verify --> [*] : pass
verify --> [*] : fail / rollback or escalate

note right of decompose
Use one Slice without a Ticket when one behavior
can be planned, implemented, tested, and reviewed
as one unit. This never removes the branch or PR gate.
end note

note right of review
Start Automatic Review immediately after the PR
is created or updated; do not wait for confirmation.
Blocking findings repeat Fix -> Test -> Redaction
when applicable -> Commit -> Push -> Review.
end note

note right of state_docs
Update the recovery snapshot only after merge,
source-branch deletion, and default-branch sync.
If tracked State / Docs change, use the same
feature-branch and PR gate for that follow-up change.
end note

note left of requirement
Docs, Code, Tests, Config, Refactor, Bugfix,
Feature, Dependency, and CI/CD changes all use
this lifecycle. No direct default-branch delivery.
end note

@enduml
